  "body": "If a user ends up putting a `/` at the end of the `url` field in their application service registration file, then Synapse tries to some to `http://somedomain.com//transactions/1` which fails on some bridges that don't gracefully handle that.\r\n\r\nThis is obviously a user problem, but it would be nice to handle.",
